id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-01-10T07:23:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T13:24:46Z","closed_at":"2026-02-18T12:51:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.dev7.official [46c8f8c5c].\n- Likely reproducible in much older versions, as per this [Reddit post](https://www.reddit.com/r/godot/comments/khw4cj/different_bluetooth_and_wired_controller_inputs/)\n    - Someone commented a possible explanation for this issue, might be worth checking out when debugging\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev7 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700F (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using a _wirelessly_ connected PS4 controller, no input is detected by Godot. Using this testing code block:\n```gdscript\nfor device in Input.get_connected_joypads():\n\tprint(\"Device ID: \", device)\n\tprint(\"Device Name: \", Input.get_joy_name(device))\n```\nI can confirm that there only one device connected called \"PS4 Controller\". However, Godot does not receive any input, which I have confirmed after seeing no controller input from this function:\n```gdscript\nfunc _input(evt):\n   print(evt)\n```\n\nThis does work as intended when directly connecting the PS4 Controller through wire.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new Godot project, and add a Node. Attach a new script to it, and inside that script add this function:\n```gdscript\nfunc _input(evt):\n   print(evt)\n```\n- Connect a PS4 Controller to your system _wirelessly_\n- Run the scene. You will notice no controller events are printed.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101382/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101382/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}